speechtext:
Resolution agreed to.
26. That any enactments founded on
(a) Resolutions 1 to 15 inclusive, 20 and 21 shall be applicable to the income of the 1942 taxation period and fiscal periods ending therein and to all subsequent periods;
Ob) Resolution 16 shall be applicable to the income of 1943 taxation period and fiscal periods ending therein and all subsequent periods;
